# ── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ⚠ This list does NOT protect you from pasting a token into a source file.
# The GitHub PAT lives in browser localStorage on each device and is typed in
# at runtime. It must never appear in this repo in any form.
.env
.env.*
*.token
secrets.json

# ── OS / editor junk ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ── Node ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# ── Scratch ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
tmp/
*.local.*
